## Next boundary

Gate 5 is still partial. This authorized diagnostic is complete; it does not
authorize changing admission policy or starting an acceptance successor.

The narrow proposed correction is limited to the proven present-image
`Labels=null` / present-container `Labels={}` pair. It must not treat absent
fields, empty strings/lists, non-empty labels, arbitrary false-like values or
other fields as equivalent. Preserve every other predicate, typed error,
source pin, no-retry rule and negative-control requirement. Synthetic tests
must demonstrate that exact exception and rejection of neighboring shapes
before a separately approved bounded native acceptance successor.

No such correction or successor has been implemented/published/executed in this
turn. No H100 is needed for this inspect/configuration correction. Dedicated
host/S3/data binding, H100/CUDA validation and actual SFT remain downstream;
production/private-integration/full-CI and real-SFT claims remain false.
